        "f1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work with any bag?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Any bag, roll or pouch — textured, embossed, generic, whatever's cheapest at Makro. You're never locked into branded refills.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What about the 12cm seal width?",
            "answer": "<p>That's precision portioning, not a limit. 12cm is ideal for single servings, braai packs and meal prep — portions seal flat, stack neatly and defrost only what you need.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does shipping take?",
            "answer": "<p>We ship from South Africa — no customs, no surprises. Most orders arrive within 2–4 working days, and shipping is FREE over R700.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's your return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>30-day money-back guarantee, plus a 12-month warranty. If it's not for you, send it back and we'll refund you — no forms, no fights.</p>"
